  "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+x-5 \\\\  & 4{x}^{2}-3x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,8{x}^{4}+6{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-23{x}^{2}+24x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+2x}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,20{x}^{2}+22x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20{x}^{2}+15x-10}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $-2{x}^{2}+x-5,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x+6.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-8{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-27{x}^{2}+24x-4}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2} & =-2{x}^{2}+x-5+\\frac{7x+6}{4{x}^{2}-3x+2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
